From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alper Ak <alperyasinak1@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 09:01:44 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] board: thead: licheepi4a: Add load addresses to the
 environment

extlinux needs kernel_addr_r and fdt_addr_r to load the kernel and the
device tree, and the Lichee Pi 4A environment defines none of them. Use the
same addresses as the BeagleV-Ahead support.

Upstream-Status: Pending
Signed-off-by: Alper Ak <alperyasinak1@gmail.com>
---
 include/configs/th1520_lpi4a.h | 4 ++++
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+)

diff --git a/include/configs/th1520_lpi4a.h b/include/configs/th1520_lpi4a.h
index 7a9b70a..cddfc5e 100644
--- a/include/configs/th1520_lpi4a.h
+++ b/include/configs/th1520_lpi4a.h
@@ -18,6 +18,10 @@
 /* Environment options */
 
 #define CFG_EXTRA_ENV_SETTINGS \
+	"pxefile_addr_r=0x30000000\0" \
+	"kernel_addr_r=0x31000000\0" \
+	"ramdisk_addr_r=0x34000000\0" \
+	"fdt_addr_r=0x40000000\0" \
 	"PS1=[LPi4A]# \0"
 
 #endif /* __TH1520_LPI4A_H */
